  "sourceText": "Honey Mustard Salad Dressing\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Friday, December 4, 2009 - 11:36pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3/4 cup diet light mayonnaise\n2 tablespoons honey\n2 tablespoons mustard\n1/2 tablespoon white vinegar\nSalt\npepper to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all ingredients thoroughly and refrigerate. Based on 8 servings. 50 calories per serving. Also good as a glaze on meats.",
